### Deployment creation via Declarative way

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment           // Replicaset and Deployment are same but Deployment objects provide more methods compared to Replicaset. Deployment objects are parent of Replicaset obejects.
metadata:
  name: myapp-deployment
  labels:
    app: myapp
    type: front-end
spec:
  replicas: 6
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      type: front-end
  template:
    metadata:
      name: myapp-pod
      labels:
        app: myapp
        type: front-end
      spec:
        containers:
        - name: nginx-container
          image: nginx
```
